flowchart TD
    start["Start here: reviewed producer contract"]:::start
    subjects["Pin source, builds, host and case manifest"]
    missing["Missing subject or required bound"]
    hold["Profile unavailable; no execution request"]
    review["Independent proposal review and integration"]
    decision["Separate explicit execution decision"]
    launch["Launcher floor and exec/map cases"]
    raw["Raw prefixes, queued bytes and holders"]
    storage["Protected storage and process-loss recovery"]
    evidence["Separate source, controls, results and unknowns"]
    native["Native service bounds and complete useful workload"]
    complete["Complete profile design and whole-design review"]
    start -->|1. Design only| subjects
    subjects -->|2. Present proposal| review
    review -->|3. Check exact subjects and scope| decision
    subjects -->|Unresolved today| missing
    missing --> hold
    decision -->|Only if authorised and admitted| launch
    decision -->|Only if authorised and admitted| raw
    decision -->|Only if authorised and admitted| storage
    launch --> evidence
    raw --> evidence
    storage --> evidence
    evidence -->|Required evidence still missing| hold
    evidence -->|Named finite observations| native
    native -->|All required bounds and fit established| complete
    native -->|Undocumented bound remains| hold
